# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data — the 5.63 GB connectome is NEVER committed.
# Obtain your own copy of MaleCNS v1.0 (CC-BY) and point FLYBRAIN_DATA_DIR at it.
# Small derived JSON summaries (stats, connectivity_facts, neuropil_stats) ARE
# committed as auditable evidence; the raw feather / npy payloads stay local.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
male_cns/*.feather
male_cns/*.progress.json
male_cns/connectome_cache/
male_cns/flat-connectome/
drosophila_connectome/data/
drosophila_connectome/dataset/
.backups/
archive/
ops/
tmp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — the live service config carries a real API key. Never commit it.
# Ship config.example.json instead; copy to config.json and set your own key.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
flybrain-connectome-mcp/mcp_connectome/config.json
config.local.json
*.local.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Runtime / caches / logs
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
api_runtime.log
.motif_api_cache.json

# Generated HTML previews (regenerate with `flybrain generate`)
*.html

# Backups / stale / logs
flybrain-connectome-mcp/generated_organisms/swarmlabs/_backup_schema_v1.0/
integrations/swarmlabs/_stale/
*.csv

# ...except the measured evidence behind the published claims (small, auditable).
# The −84% wire-cost and the E2E results are only checkable if these ship.
!integrations/swarmlabs/ga_phase3_runs_*.csv
!integrations/swarmlabs/ga_phase3_log_*.csv
!integrations/swarmlabs/e2e_bio_advantage.csv
!integrations/swarmlabs/e2e_batch_stats.csv
!integrations/swarmlabs/e2e_batch_results.csv
!integrations/swarmlabs/benchmark_module_stacking.csv

